# Copy to .env.local and replace the placeholder ANON key with your real one.
#
# Get the key from: Supabase dashboard -> Project Settings -> API.
# Use the PUBLISHABLE key (starts with sb_publishable_), NOT the secret one.
# Both env vars are safe in a private repo and intended for the browser anyway
# (RLS + column-level grants stop anon reading anything beyond the sanitised
# public_freebusy view).

